    "title": "Cheryl Ann McGowan - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brittany Gasama ,\n14 hours ago Cheryl Ann McGowan, age 70, passed away on January 17, 2026. We are all saddened to share that mom, grandma, and for many our friend, Cheryl Ann McGowan, age 70, of Springfield, Missouri, of January 17, 2026, after a long fight with medical complications. She entered this life on December 26, 1955, the daughter of James McGowan II and Agnes Nehila in McKeesport, Pennsylvania. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
